```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "admit, remove or cosign a PersonaGroup in the Kahu cabal"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.kahu.admits", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.kahu.admits"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.kahu.admits"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.kahu.admits ~ admission takes the seat quorum

`lares nexus cabal <admit | remove | cosign | standing>` admits a PersonaGroup into a Nexus's Kahu cabal at the seat quorum, or takes it out; short of the threshold the act stays a partial (`--out`), and another vault's `cosign <partial> --act <cid>` adds its seats once a person reads the act CID aloud. `standing <group>` reads where the group stands as of the last sync.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ admit · standing

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`admit` params=`sub/admit group/<group> out/p.json ~ open an admission`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`standing` params=`sub/standing group/<group> ~ read a group's standing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ sub · group · act · nexus · out

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sub` params=`takes/word needs/required seat/1 as/<admit|remove|cosign|standing> ~ the cabal act`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`group` params=`takes/id needs/required seat/2 as/<group|partial> ~ the group, or the partial a cosign reads`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`act` params=`takes/cid ~ beside cosign, the act CID read aloud`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus, by AID; absent, the primary charter's`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`out` params=`takes/host-path ~ write the partial for the next vault`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ quorum

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`quorum` params=`who/hand key/seat ~ the seat quorum signs`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.kahu.admits sub/standing group/<group>]] ~ an unknown act, or a missing group or --act`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ acted

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`acted` params=`exit/0 ~ the act landed, the partial written, or the standing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

